# The cluster reads the drift compare makes (gt-cd1iso): it reads the rendered
# Deployments and the gate runner's ConfigMap by name, `kubectl get
# <kind>/<name> -n <namespace> -o json`, through the daemon's service account.
# One line per read as `<verb> <resource>`, granted by the one ClusterRole in
# deploy/k8s/drift-rbac.yaml, which reads in every namespace.
#
# A kind the compare comes to read joins this file and the ClusterRole together;
# TestTownClusterDriftReadsMatchTheGolden fails if the compare gains a kind without
# a line here, and TestDriftRBACCoverageProblemsReportsEachFailingBranch holds the
# golden and the grant to one another.
get deployments
get configmaps
